title: "PDF Editor Traces: one edited figure, 18 PDF editors"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-11-17
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24315588
authors:
  - family-names: Haiduchyk
    given-names: Borys
    affiliation: Atomara
    website: https://atomara.io
url: https://atomara.io/blog/pdf-editor-traces
repository-code: https://github.com/atomara-io/pdf-editor-traces
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - pdf
  - document forensics
  - pdf editing
  - tamper detection
abstract: >-
  Seven synthetic documents, each edited by hand in 17 online PDF editors and
  desktop Word: 109 edited files, with a per-file record of what the editor
  changed besides the figure (revisions, metadata, content-stream marks, fonts,
  and whether the old figure is still in the file).
